{"id":"97fe560478d37064","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-language-with-truth.md","title":"带真理谓词的语言","display":"df-language-with-truth — 带真理谓词的语言","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-language-with-truth","aliases":["91-df-language-with-truth"],"display":"df-language-with-truth — 带真理谓词的语言","depends_on":["[[91-df-ground-language]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-language-with-truth"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-language-with-truth</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-language-with-truth — 带真理谓词的语言"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2ad7561edabb2148\" href=\"?note=2ad7561edabb2148\" title=\"91-df-ground-language\">91-df-ground-language</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-language-with-truth-—-带真理谓词的语言-$\\mathcal{L}_T$\">df-language-with-truth — 带真理谓词的语言 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{L}_T\">\\(\\mathcal{L}_T\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{L}_0\">\\(\\mathcal{L}_0\\)</span> (基础语言, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2ad7561edabb2148\" href=\"?note=2ad7561edabb2148\" title=\"91-df-ground-language\">91-df-ground-language</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\notin\\mathcal L_0\">\\(T\\notin\\mathcal L_0\\)</span> (新的元数为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> 的谓词符号)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Const}_{\\mathcal L_0},\n\\mathrm{Fun}^{n}_{\\mathcal L_0},\n\\mathrm{Pred}^{n}_{\\mathcal L_0}\">\\(\\mathrm{Const}_{\\mathcal L_0},\n\\mathrm{Fun}^{n}_{\\mathcal L_0},\n\\mathrm{Pred}^{n}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\)</span> (基础语言签名的分型符号类)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}language\\text{-}with\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\n\\mathcal L_T\\coloneqq\n\\mathcal L_0[T],\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Pred}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_T}\n=\\mathrm{Pred}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\cup\\{T\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Const}_{\\mathcal L_T}\n=\\mathrm{Const}_{\\mathcal L_0},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}language\\text{-}with\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\n\\mathcal L_T\\coloneqq\n\\mathcal L_0[T],\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Pred}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_T}\n=\\mathrm{Pred}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\cup\\{T\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Const}_{\\mathcal L_T}\n=\\mathrm{Const}_{\\mathcal L_0},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Fun}^{n}_{\\mathcal L_T}\n=\\mathrm{Fun}^{n}_{\\mathcal L_0}\n\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{1\\}\\,\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Pred}^{n}_{\\mathcal L_T}\n=\\mathrm{Pred}^{n}_{\\mathcal L_0}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Fun}^{n}_{\\mathcal L_T}\n=\\mathrm{Fun}^{n}_{\\mathcal L_0}\n\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{1\\}\\,\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Pred}^{n}_{\\mathcal L_T}\n=\\mathrm{Pred}^{n}_{\\mathcal L_0}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{L}_T\">\\(\\mathcal{L}_T\\)</span> : 带真理谓词的语言（扩展语言）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> : 真理谓词（一元谓词）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Pred}_{\\mathcal{L}_T}^1\">\\(\\mathrm{Pred}_{\\mathcal{L}_T}^1\\)</span> : 一元谓词符号集</li>\n</ul>\n<p>说明：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{L}_T\">\\(\\mathcal{L}_T\\)</span>是在基础算术语言<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{L}_0\">\\(\\mathcal{L}_0\\)</span>上添加真理谓词<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>得到的扩展语言。这个语言可以谈论句子是否为真，从而支持真理理论的公理化表达。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-language-with-truth-—-带真理谓词的语言-$\\mathcal{L}_T$","text":"df-language-with-truth — 带真理谓词的语言 $\\mathcal{L}_T$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-ground-language","status":"resolved","id":"2ad7561edabb2148","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-ground-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-ground-language","status":"resolved","id":"2ad7561edabb2148","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal{L}_0$ (基础语言, see [[91-df-ground-language]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal{L}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{L}_0","display":false},{"tex":"T\\notin\\mathcal L_0","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Const}_{\\mathcal L_0},\n\\mathrm{Fun}^{n}_{\\mathcal L_0},\n\\mathrm{Pred}^{n}_{\\mathcal L_0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}language\\text{-}with\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\n\\mathcal L_T\\coloneqq\n\\mathcal L_0[T],\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Pred}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_T}\n=\\mathrm{Pred}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\cup\\{T\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Const}_{\\mathcal L_T}\n=\\mathrm{Const}_{\\mathcal L_0},","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Fun}^{n}_{\\mathcal L_T}\n=\\mathrm{Fun}^{n}_{\\mathcal L_0}\n\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{1\\}\\,\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Pred}^{n}_{\\mathcal L_T}\n=\\mathrm{Pred}^{n}_{\\mathcal L_0}\n\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal{L}_T","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":